      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should check with them but i'm already at the grocery store lol. i just feel like since they are natural veggies they should be fine right? i'm thinking like like 2 large handfuls of kale and a bunch of spinach every single day. it shouldn't be that big of a deal for the medicine can it?",
